        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Ah, you are looking to be the subject of a song, are you?  \n\nWell, there is no better way to be the subject of a song than to do something heroic.  I have heard tale of a <CUSTOM100> holed up in a nearby cave, but I don't have the exact location.\n\nI bet I could write a song about an adventurer such as yourself battling a <CUSTOM100>..."
